{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>I sojourned.</b> I did not become a lord or a notable but a stranger — you have no reason to hate me on account of your father's blessing, which blessed me 'be a lord to your brothers,' for it was not fulfilled in me. Another interpretation: גַּרְתִּי — in gematria, תרי״ג. That is: with Lavan I sojourned, and the תרי״ג commandments I kept, and I did not learn from his evil deeds."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:39.996442832Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}